{"id":"war-is-kind","title":"War is Kind","author":"Stephen Crane","year":"1899","note":"War is Kind — a full sitting.","minutes":82,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Poem","place":"Poem","reentry":"Do not weep, maiden, for war is kind.","prompt":"A word from this stretch."},{"id":"s1","title":"Intrigue","place":"Intrigue","reentry":"Thou art my love,","prompt":"A word from this stretch."},{"id":"s2","title":"And--surely--","place":"And--surely--","reentry":"This should leave a man content?","prompt":"A word from this stretch."}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"Do not weep, maiden, for war is kind."},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"Because your lover threw wild hands toward the sky"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the affrighted steed ran on alone,"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"Do not weep."},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"War is kind."},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"Hoarse, booming drums of the"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"regiment,"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"Little souls who thirst for fight,"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"These men were born to drill and die."},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"The unexplained glory files above"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"them,"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"Great is the battle-god, great, and his"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"kingdom--"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"A field where a thousand corpses lie."},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"Do not weep, babe, for war is kind."},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"Because your father tumbled in the yellow"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"trenches,"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"Raged at his breast, gulped and died,"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"Do not weep."},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"War is kind."},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"Swift blazing flag of the regiment,"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"Eagle with crest of red and gold,"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"These men were born to drill and die."},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"Point for them the virtue of the slaughter,"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"Make plain to them the excellence of killing"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"And a field where a thousand corpses"},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"lie."},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"Mother whose heart hung humble as a button"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"On the bright splendid shroud of your son,"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"Do not weep."},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"War is kind."},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"What says the sea, little shell?"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"What says the sea?"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Long has our brother been silent to us,"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Kept his message for the ships,"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Awkward ships, stupid ships.\""},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The sea bids you mourn, O Pines,"},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Sing low in the moonlight."},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"He sends tale of the land of doom,"},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Of place where endless falls"},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"A rain of women's tears,"},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"And men in grey robes--"},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Men in grey robes--"},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Chant the unknown pain.\""},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"What says the sea, little shell?"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"What says the sea?"},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Long has our brother been silent to us,"},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Kept is message for the ships,"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Puny ships, silly ships.\""},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The sea bids you teach, O Pines,"},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Sing low in the moonlight;"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Teach the gold of patience,"},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Cry gospel of gentle hands,"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Cry a brotherhood of hearts."},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The sea bids you teach, O Pines.\""},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"And where is the reward, little shell?"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"What says the sea?"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Long has our brother been silent to us,"},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Kept his message for the ships,"},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Puny ships, silly ships.\""},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"No word says the sea, O Pines,"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"No word says the sea."},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Long will your brother be silent to you,"},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Keep his message for the ships,"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"O puny ships, silly pines.\""},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"To the maiden"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"The sea was blue meadow,"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"Alive with little froth-people"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"Singing."},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"To the sailor, wrecked,"},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"The sea was dead grey walls"},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"Superlative in vacancy,"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"Upon which nevertheless at fateful time"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"Was written"},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"The grim hatred of nature."},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"A little ink more or less!"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"It surely can't matter?"},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"Even the sky and the opulent sea,"},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"The plains and the hills, aloof,"},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"Hear the uproar of all these books."},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"But it is only a little ink more or less."},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"What?"},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"You define me God with these trinkets?"},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"Can my misery meal on an ordered walking"},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of surpliced numskulls?"},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"And a fanfare of lights?"},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"Or even upon the measured pulpitings"},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of the familiar false and true?"},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is this God?"},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where, then is hell?"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"Show me some bastard mushrooms"},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sprung from a pollution of blood."},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"It is better."},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where is God?"},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Have you ever made a just man?\""},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Oh, I have made three,\" answered"},{"id":"s0-96","sceneId":"s0","text":"God,"},{"id":"s0-97","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"But two of them are dead,"},{"id":"s0-98","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"And the third--"},{"id":"s0-99","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Listen! Listen!"},{"id":"s0-100","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"And you will hear the thud of his defeat.\""},{"id":"s0-101","sceneId":"s0","text":"I explain the silvered passing of a ship"},{"id":"s0-102","sceneId":"s0","text":"at night,"},{"id":"s0-103","sceneId":"s0","text":"The sweep of each sad lost wave,"},{"id":"s0-104","sceneId":"s0","text":"The dwindling boom of the steel thing's striving,"},{"id":"s0-105","sceneId":"s0","text":"The little cry of a man to a man,"},{"id":"s0-106","sceneId":"s0","text":"A shadow falling across the greyer night,"},{"id":"s0-107","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the sinking of the small star;"},{"id":"s0-108","sceneId":"s0","text":"Then the waste, the far waste of waters,"},{"id":"s0-109","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the soft lashing of black waves"},{"id":"s0-110","sceneId":"s0","text":"For long and in loneliness."},{"id":"s0-111","sceneId":"s0","text":"Remember, thou, O ship of love,"},{"id":"s0-112","sceneId":"s0","text":"Thou leavest a far waste of waters,"},{"id":"s0-113","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the soft lashing of black waves"},{"id":"s0-114","sceneId":"s0","text":"For long and in loneliness."},{"id":"s0-115","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"I have heard the sunset song of the"},{"id":"s0-116","sceneId":"s0","text":"birches,"},{"id":"s0-117","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"A white melody in the silence,"},{"id":"s0-118","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"I have seen a quarrel of the pines."},{"id":"s0-119","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"At nightfall"},{"id":"s0-120","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The little grasses have rushed by me"},{"id":"s0-121","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"With the wind men."},{"id":"s0-122","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"These things have I lived,\" quoth the"},{"id":"s0-123","sceneId":"s0","text":"maniac,"},{"id":"s0-124","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Possessing only eyes and ears."},{"id":"s0-125","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"But you--"},{"id":"s0-126","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"You don green spectacles before you look at roses.\""},{"id":"s0-127","sceneId":"s0","text":"Fast rode the knight"},{"id":"s0-128","sceneId":"s0","text":"With spurs, hot and reeking,"},{"id":"s0-129","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ever waving an eager sword,"},{"id":"s0-130","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"To save my lady!\""},{"id":"s0-131","sceneId":"s0","text":"Fast rode the knight,"},{"id":"s0-132","sceneId":"s0","text":"And leaped from saddle to war."},{"id":"s0-133","sceneId":"s0","text":"Men of steel flickered and gleamed"},{"id":"s0-134","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like riot of silver lights,"},{"id":"s0-135","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the gold of the knight's good banner"},{"id":"s0-136","sceneId":"s0","text":"Still waved on a castle wall."},{"id":"s0-137","sceneId":"s0","text":".    .    .    .    .    .    ."},{"id":"s0-138","sceneId":"s0","text":"A horse,"},{"id":"s0-139","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blowing, staggering, bloody thing,"},{"id":"s0-140","sceneId":"s0","text":"Forgotten at foot of castle wall."},{"id":"s0-141","sceneId":"s0","text":"A horse"},{"id":"s0-142","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dead at foot of castle wall."},{"id":"s0-143","sceneId":"s0","text":"Forth went the candid man"},{"id":"s0-144","sceneId":"s0","text":"And spoke freely to the wind--"},{"id":"s0-145","sceneId":"s0","text":"When he looked about him he was in a far"},{"id":"s0-146","sceneId":"s0","text":"strange country."},{"id":"s0-147","sceneId":"s0","text":"Forth went the candid man"},{"id":"s0-148","sceneId":"s0","text":"And spoke freely to the stars--"},{"id":"s0-149","sceneId":"s0","text":"Yellow light tore sight from his eye."},{"id":"s0-150","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"My good fool,\" said a learned bystander,"},{"id":"s0-151","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Your operations are mad.\""},{"id":"s0-152","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"You are too candid,\" cried the candid man."},{"id":"s0-153","sceneId":"s0","text":"And when his stick left the head of the"},{"id":"s0-154","sceneId":"s0","text":"learned bystander"},{"id":"s0-155","sceneId":"s0","text":"It was two sticks."},{"id":"s0-156","sceneId":"s0","text":"You tell me this is God?"},{"id":"s0-157","sceneId":"s0","text":"I tell you this is a printed list,"},{"id":"s0-158","sceneId":"s0","text":"A burning candle and an ass."},{"id":"s0-159","sceneId":"s0","text":"On the desert"},{"id":"s0-160","sceneId":"s0","text":"A silence from the moon's deepest"},{"id":"s0-161","sceneId":"s0","text":"valley."},{"id":"s0-162","sceneId":"s0","text":"Fire rays fall athwart the robes"},{"id":"s0-163","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of hooded men, squat and dumb."},{"id":"s0-164","sceneId":"s0","text":"Before them, a woman"},{"id":"s0-165","sceneId":"s0","text":"Moves to the blowing of shrill whistles"},{"id":"s0-166","sceneId":"s0","text":"And distant thunder of drums,"},{"id":"s0-167","sceneId":"s0","text":"While mystic things, sinuous, dull with"},{"id":"s0-168","sceneId":"s0","text":"terrible color,"},{"id":"s0-169","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sleepily fondle her body"},{"id":"s0-170","sceneId":"s0","text":"Or move at her will, swishing stealthily over"},{"id":"s0-171","sceneId":"s0","text":"the sand."},{"id":"s0-172","sceneId":"s0","text":"The snakes whisper softly;"},{"id":"s0-173","sceneId":"s0","text":"The whispering, whispering snakes,"},{"id":"s0-174","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dreaming and swaying and staring,"},{"id":"s0-175","sceneId":"s0","text":"But always whispering, softly whispering."},{"id":"s0-176","sceneId":"s0","text":"The wind streams from the lone reaches"},{"id":"s0-177","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of Arabia, solemn with night,"},{"id":"s0-178","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the wild fire makes shimmer of blood"},{"id":"s0-179","sceneId":"s0","text":"Over the robes of the hooded men"},{"id":"s0-180","sceneId":"s0","text":"Squat and dumb."},{"id":"s0-181","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bands of moving bronze, emerald, yellow,"},{"id":"s0-182","sceneId":"s0","text":"Circle the throat and arms of her,"},{"id":"s0-183","sceneId":"s0","text":"And over the sands serpents move warily"},{"id":"s0-184","sceneId":"s0","text":"Slow, menacing and submissive,"},{"id":"s0-185","sceneId":"s0","text":"Swinging to the whistles and drums,"},{"id":"s0-186","sceneId":"s0","text":"The whispering, whispering snakes,"},{"id":"s0-187","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dreaming and swaying and staring,"},{"id":"s0-188","sceneId":"s0","text":"But always whispering, softly whispering."},{"id":"s0-189","sceneId":"s0","text":"The dignity of the accursed;"},{"id":"s0-190","sceneId":"s0","text":"The glory of slavery, despair, death,"},{"id":"s0-191","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is in the dance of the whispering snakes."},{"id":"s0-192","sceneId":"s0","text":"A newspaper is a collection of half-injustices"},{"id":"s0-193","sceneId":"s0","text":"Which, bawled by boys from mile to mile,"},{"id":"s0-194","sceneId":"s0","text":"Spreads its curious opinion"},{"id":"s0-195","sceneId":"s0","text":"To a million merciful and sneering men,"},{"id":"s0-196","sceneId":"s0","text":"While families cuddle the joys of the fireside"},{"id":"s0-197","sceneId":"s0","text":"When spurred by tale of dire lone agony."},{"id":"s0-198","sceneId":"s0","text":"A newspaper is a court"},{"id":"s0-199","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where every one is kindly and unfairly tried"},{"id":"s0-200","sceneId":"s0","text":"By a squalor of honest men."},{"id":"s0-201","sceneId":"s0","text":"A newspaper is a market"},{"id":"s0-202","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where wisdom sells its freedom"},{"id":"s0-203","sceneId":"s0","text":"And melons are crowned by the crowd."},{"id":"s0-204","sceneId":"s0","text":"A newspaper is a game"},{"id":"s0-205","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where his error scores the player victory"},{"id":"s0-206","sceneId":"s0","text":"While another's skill wins death."},{"id":"s0-207","sceneId":"s0","text":"A newspaper is a symbol;"},{"id":"s0-208","sceneId":"s0","text":"It is fetless life's chronical,"},{"id":"s0-209","sceneId":"s0","text":"A collection of loud tales"},{"id":"s0-210","sceneId":"s0","text":"Concentrating eternal stupidities,"},{"id":"s0-211","sceneId":"s0","text":"That in remote ages lived unhaltered,"},{"id":"s0-212","sceneId":"s0","text":"Roaming through a fenceless world."},{"id":"s0-213","sceneId":"s0","text":"The wayfarer,"},{"id":"s0-214","sceneId":"s0","text":"Perceiving the pathway to truth,"},{"id":"s0-215","sceneId":"s0","text":"Was struck with astonishment."},{"id":"s0-216","sceneId":"s0","text":"It was thickly grown with weeds."},{"id":"s0-217","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Ha,\" he said,"},{"id":"s0-218","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"I see that none has passed here"},{"id":"s0-219","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"In a long time.\""},{"id":"s0-220","sceneId":"s0","text":"Later he saw that each weed"},{"id":"s0-221","sceneId":"s0","text":"Was a singular knife."},{"id":"s0-222","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Well,\" he mumbled at last,"},{"id":"s0-223","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Doubtless there are other roads.\""},{"id":"s0-224","sceneId":"s0","text":"A slant of sun on dull brown walls,"},{"id":"s0-225","sceneId":"s0","text":"A forgotten sky of bashful blue."},{"id":"s0-226","sceneId":"s0","text":"Toward God a mighty hymn,"},{"id":"s0-227","sceneId":"s0","text":"A song of collisions and cries,"},{"id":"s0-228","sceneId":"s0","text":"Rumbling wheels, hoof-beats, bells,"},{"id":"s0-229","sceneId":"s0","text":"Welcomes, farewells, love-calls, final moans,"},{"id":"s0-230","sceneId":"s0","text":"Voices of joy, idiocy, warning, despair,"},{"id":"s0-231","sceneId":"s0","text":"The unknown appeals of brutes,"},{"id":"s0-232","sceneId":"s0","text":"The chanting of flowers,"},{"id":"s0-233","sceneId":"s0","text":"The screams of cut trees,"},{"id":"s0-234","sceneId":"s0","text":"The senseless babble of hens and wise men--"},{"id":"s0-235","sceneId":"s0","text":"A cluttered incoherency that says at the"},{"id":"s0-236","sceneId":"s0","text":"stars;"},{"id":"s0-237","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"O God, save us!\""},{"id":"s0-238","sceneId":"s0","text":"Once a man clambering to the housetops"},{"id":"s0-239","sceneId":"s0","text":"Appealed to the heavens."},{"id":"s0-240","sceneId":"s0","text":"With a strong voice he called to the deaf"},{"id":"s0-241","sceneId":"s0","text":"spheres;"},{"id":"s0-242","sceneId":"s0","text":"A warrior's shout he raised to the suns."},{"id":"s0-243","sceneId":"s0","text":"Lo, at last, there was a dot on the clouds,"},{"id":"s0-244","sceneId":"s0","text":"And--at last and at last--"},{"id":"s0-245","sceneId":"s0","text":"--God--the sky was filled with armies."},{"id":"s0-246","sceneId":"s0","text":"There was a man with tongue of wood"},{"id":"s0-247","sceneId":"s0","text":"Who essayed to sing,"},{"id":"s0-248","sceneId":"s0","text":"And in truth it was lamentable."},{"id":"s0-249","sceneId":"s0","text":"But there was one who heard"},{"id":"s0-250","sceneId":"s0","text":"The clip-clapper of this tongue of wood"},{"id":"s0-251","sceneId":"s0","text":"And knew what the man"},{"id":"s0-252","sceneId":"s0","text":"Wished to sing,"},{"id":"s0-253","sceneId":"s0","text":"And with that the singer was content."},{"id":"s0-254","sceneId":"s0","text":"The successful man has thrust himself"},{"id":"s0-255","sceneId":"s0","text":"Through the water of the years,"},{"id":"s0-256","sceneId":"s0","text":"Reeking wet with mistakes,--"},{"id":"s0-257","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bloody mistakes;"},{"id":"s0-258","sceneId":"s0","text":"Slimed with victories over the lesser,"},{"id":"s0-259","sceneId":"s0","text":"A figure thankful on the shore of money."},{"id":"s0-260","sceneId":"s0","text":"Then, with the bones of fools"},{"id":"s0-261","sceneId":"s0","text":"He buys silken banners"},{"id":"s0-262","sceneId":"s0","text":"Limned with his triumphant face;"},{"id":"s0-263","sceneId":"s0","text":"With the skins of wise men"},{"id":"s0-264","sceneId":"s0","text":"He buys the trivial bows of all."},{"id":"s0-265","sceneId":"s0","text":"Flesh painted with marrow"},{"id":"s0-266","sceneId":"s0","text":"Contributes a coverlet,"},{"id":"s0-267","sceneId":"s0","text":"A coverlet for his contented slumber."},{"id":"s0-268","sceneId":"s0","text":"In guiltless ignorance, in ignorant guilt,"},{"id":"s0-269","sceneId":"s0","text":"He delivered his secrets to the riven multitude."},{"id":"s0-270","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Thus I defended: Thus I wrought.\""},{"id":"s0-271","sceneId":"s0","text":"Complacent, smiling,"},{"id":"s0-272","sceneId":"s0","text":"He stands heavily on the dead."},{"id":"s0-273","sceneId":"s0","text":"Erect on a pillar of skulls"},{"id":"s0-274","sceneId":"s0","text":"He declaims his trampling of babes;"},{"id":"s0-275","sceneId":"s0","text":"Smirking, fat, dripping,"},{"id":"s0-276","sceneId":"s0","text":"He makes speech in guiltless ignorance,"},{"id":"s0-277","sceneId":"s0","text":"Innocence."},{"id":"s0-278","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the night"},{"id":"s0-279","sceneId":"s0","text":"Grey heavy clouds muffled the valleys,"},{"id":"s0-280","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the peaks looked toward God alone."},{"id":"s0-281","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"O Master that movest the wind with a"},{"id":"s0-282","sceneId":"s0","text":"finger,"},{"id":"s0-283","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Humble, idle, futile peaks are we."},{"id":"s0-284","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Grant that we may run swiftly across"},{"id":"s0-285","sceneId":"s0","text":"the world"},{"id":"s0-286","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"To huddle in worship at Thy feet.\""},{"id":"s0-287","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the morning"},{"id":"s0-288","sceneId":"s0","text":"A noise of men at work came the clear blue miles,"},{"id":"s0-289","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the little black cities were apparent."},{"id":"s0-290","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"O Master that knowest the meaning of raindrops,"},{"id":"s0-291","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Humble, idle, futile peaks are we."},{"id":"s0-292","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Give voice to us, we pray, O Lord,"},{"id":"s0-293","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"That we may sing Thy goodness to the sun.\""},{"id":"s0-294","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the evening"},{"id":"s0-295","sceneId":"s0","text":"The far valleys were sprinkled with tiny lights."},{"id":"s0-296","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"O Master,"},{"id":"s0-297","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Thou that knowest the value of kings and birds,"},{"id":"s0-298","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Thou hast made us humble, idle, futile peaks."},{"id":"s0-299","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Thous only needest eternal patience;"},{"id":"s0-300","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"We bow to Thy wisdom, O Lord--"},{"id":"s0-301","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Humble, idle, futile peaks.\""},{"id":"s0-302","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the night"},{"id":"s0-303","sceneId":"s0","text":"Grey heavy clouds muffles the valleys,"},{"id":"s0-304","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the peaks looked toward God alone."},{"id":"s0-305","sceneId":"s0","text":"The chatter of a death-demon from a tree-top."},{"id":"s0-306","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blood--blood and torn grass--"},{"id":"s0-307","sceneId":"s0","text":"Had marked the rise of his agony--"},{"id":"s0-308","sceneId":"s0","text":"This lone hunter."},{"id":"s0-309","sceneId":"s0","text":"The grey-green woods impassive"},{"id":"s0-310","sceneId":"s0","text":"Had watched the threshing of his limbs."},{"id":"s0-311","sceneId":"s0","text":"A canoe with flashing paddle,"},{"id":"s0-312","sceneId":"s0","text":"A girl with soft searching eyes,"},{"id":"s0-313","sceneId":"s0","text":"A call: \"John!\""},{"id":"s0-314","sceneId":"s0","text":".    .    .    .    .    .    ."},{"id":"s0-315","sceneId":"s0","text":"Come, arise, hunter!"},{"id":"s0-316","sceneId":"s0","text":"Can you not hear?"},{"id":"s0-317","sceneId":"s0","text":"The chatter of a death-demon from a tree-"},{"id":"s0-318","sceneId":"s0","text":"top."},{"id":"s0-319","sceneId":"s0","text":"The impact of a dollar upon the heart"},{"id":"s0-320","sceneId":"s0","text":"Smiles warm red light,"},{"id":"s0-321","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sweeping from the hearth rosily upon the"},{"id":"s0-322","sceneId":"s0","text":"white table,"},{"id":"s0-323","sceneId":"s0","text":"With the hanging cool velvet shadows"},{"id":"s0-324","sceneId":"s0","text":"Moving softly upon the door."},{"id":"s0-325","sceneId":"s0","text":"The impact of a million dollars"},{"id":"s0-326","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is a crash of flunkys,"},{"id":"s0-327","sceneId":"s0","text":"And yawning emblems of Persia"},{"id":"s0-328","sceneId":"s0","text":"Cheeked against oak, France and a sabre,"},{"id":"s0-329","sceneId":"s0","text":"The outcry of old beauty"},{"id":"s0-330","sceneId":"s0","text":"Whored by pimping merchants"},{"id":"s0-331","sceneId":"s0","text":"To submission before wine and chatter."},{"id":"s0-332","sceneId":"s0","text":"Silly rich peasants stamp the carpets of men,"},{"id":"s0-333","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dead men who dreamed fragrance and light"},{"id":"s0-334","sceneId":"s0","text":"Into their woof, their lives;"},{"id":"s0-335","sceneId":"s0","text":"The rug of an honest bear"},{"id":"s0-336","sceneId":"s0","text":"Under the feet of a cryptic slave"},{"id":"s0-337","sceneId":"s0","text":"Who speaks always of baubles,"},{"id":"s0-338","sceneId":"s0","text":"Forgetting state, multitude, work, and state,"},{"id":"s0-339","sceneId":"s0","text":"Champing and mouthing of hats,"},{"id":"s0-340","sceneId":"s0","text":"Making ratful squeak of hats,"},{"id":"s0-341","sceneId":"s0","text":"Hats."},{"id":"s0-342","sceneId":"s0","text":"A man said to the universe:"},{"id":"s0-343","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Sir, I exist!\""},{"id":"s0-344","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"However,\" replied the universe,"},{"id":"s0-345","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The fact has not created in me"},{"id":"s0-346","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"A sense of obligation.\""},{"id":"s0-347","sceneId":"s0","text":"When the prophet, a complacent fat"},{"id":"s0-348","sceneId":"s0","text":"man,"},{"id":"s0-349","sceneId":"s0","text":"Arrived at the mountain-top,"},{"id":"s0-350","sceneId":"s0","text":"He cried: \"Woe to my knowledge!"},{"id":"s0-351","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"I intended to see good white lands"},{"id":"s0-352","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"And bad black lands,"},{"id":"s0-353","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"But the scene is grey.\""},{"id":"s0-354","sceneId":"s0","text":"There was a land where lived no"},{"id":"s0-355","sceneId":"s0","text":"violets."},{"id":"s0-356","sceneId":"s0","text":"A traveller at once demanded: \"Why?\""},{"id":"s0-357","sceneId":"s0","text":"The people told him:"},{"id":"s0-358","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Once the violets of this place spoke thus:"},{"id":"s0-359","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"'Until some woman freely give her lover"},{"id":"s0-360","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"'To another woman"},{"id":"s0-361","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"'We will fight in bloody scuffle.'\""},{"id":"s0-362","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sadly the people added:"},{"id":"s0-363","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"There are no violets here.\""},{"id":"s0-364","sceneId":"s0","text":"There was one I met upon the road"},{"id":"s0-365","sceneId":"s0","text":"Who looked at me with kind eyes."},{"id":"s0-366","sceneId":"s0","text":"He said: \"Show me of your wares.\""},{"id":"s0-367","sceneId":"s0","text":"And I did,"},{"id":"s0-368","sceneId":"s0","text":"Holding forth one,"},{"id":"s0-369","sceneId":"s0","text":"He said: \"It is a sin.\""},{"id":"s0-370","sceneId":"s0","text":"Then I held forth another."},{"id":"s0-371","sceneId":"s0","text":"He said: \"It is a sin.\""},{"id":"s0-372","sceneId":"s0","text":"Then I held forth another."},{"id":"s0-373","sceneId":"s0","text":"He said: \"It is a sin.\""},{"id":"s0-374","sceneId":"s0","text":"And so to the end."},{"id":"s0-375","sceneId":"s0","text":"Always He said: \"It is a sin.\""},{"id":"s0-376","sceneId":"s0","text":"At last, I cried out:"},{"id":"s0-377","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"But I have non other.\""},{"id":"s0-378","sceneId":"s0","text":"He looked at me"},{"id":"s0-379","sceneId":"s0","text":"With kinder eyes."},{"id":"s0-380","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Poor soul,\" he said."},{"id":"s0-381","sceneId":"s0","text":"Aye, workman, make me a dream,"},{"id":"s0-382","sceneId":"s0","text":"A dream for my love."},{"id":"s0-383","sceneId":"s0","text":"Cunningly weave sunlight,"},{"id":"s0-384","sceneId":"s0","text":"Breezes, and flowers."},{"id":"s0-385","sceneId":"s0","text":"Let it be of the cloth of meadows."},{"id":"s0-386","sceneId":"s0","text":"And--good workman--"},{"id":"s0-387","sceneId":"s0","text":"And let there be a man walking thereon."},{"id":"s0-388","sceneId":"s0","text":"Each small gleam was a voice,"},{"id":"s0-389","sceneId":"s0","text":"A lantern voice--"},{"id":"s0-390","sceneId":"s0","text":"In little songs of carmine, violet, green, gold."},{"id":"s0-391","sceneId":"s0","text":"A chorus of colors came over the water;"},{"id":"s0-392","sceneId":"s0","text":"The wondrous leaf-shadow no longer wavered,"},{"id":"s0-393","sceneId":"s0","text":"No pines crooned on the hills,"},{"id":"s0-394","sceneId":"s0","text":"The blue night was elsewhere a silence,"},{"id":"s0-395","sceneId":"s0","text":"When the chorus of colors came over the"},{"id":"s0-396","sceneId":"s0","text":"water,"},{"id":"s0-397","sceneId":"s0","text":"Little songs of carmine, violet, green, gold."},{"id":"s0-398","sceneId":"s0","text":"Small glowing pebbles"},{"id":"s0-399","sceneId":"s0","text":"Thrown on the dark plane of evening"},{"id":"s0-400","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sing good ballads of God"},{"id":"s0-401","sceneId":"s0","text":"And eternity, with soul's rest."},{"id":"s0-402","sceneId":"s0","text":"Little priests, little holy fathers,"},{"id":"s0-403","sceneId":"s0","text":"None can doubt the truth of hour hymning."},{"id":"s0-404","sceneId":"s0","text":"When the marvellous chorus comes over the"},{"id":"s0-405","sceneId":"s0","text":"water,"},{"id":"s0-406","sceneId":"s0","text":"Songs of carmine, violet, green, gold."},{"id":"s0-407","sceneId":"s0","text":"The trees in the garden rained flowers."},{"id":"s0-408","sceneId":"s0","text":"Children ran there joyously."},{"id":"s0-409","sceneId":"s0","text":"They gathered the flowers"},{"id":"s0-410","sceneId":"s0","text":"Each to himself."},{"id":"s0-411","sceneId":"s0","text":"Now there were some"},{"id":"s0-412","sceneId":"s0","text":"Who gathered great heaps--"},{"id":"s0-413","sceneId":"s0","text":"Having opportunity and skill--"},{"id":"s0-414","sceneId":"s0","text":"Until, behold, only chance blossoms"},{"id":"s0-415","sceneId":"s0","text":"Remained for the feeble."},{"id":"s0-416","sceneId":"s0","text":"Then a little spindling tutor"},{"id":"s0-417","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ran importantly to the father, crying:"},{"id":"s0-418","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Pray, come hither!"},{"id":"s0-419","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"See this unjust thing in your garden!\""},{"id":"s0-420","sceneId":"s0","text":"But when the father had surveyed,"},{"id":"s0-421","sceneId":"s0","text":"He admonished the tutor:"},{"id":"s0-422","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Not so, small sage!"},{"id":"s0-423","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"This thing is just."},{"id":"s0-424","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"For, look you,"},{"id":"s0-425","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Are not they who possess the flowers"},{"id":"s0-426","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Stronger, bolder, shrewder"},{"id":"s0-427","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Than they who have none?"},{"id":"s0-428","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Why should the strong--"},{"id":"s0-429","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The beautiful strong--"},{"id":"s0-430","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"Why should they not have the flowers?"},{"id":"s0-431","sceneId":"s0","text":"Upon reflection, the tutor bowed to the"},{"id":"s0-432","sceneId":"s0","text":"ground."},{"id":"s0-433","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"My lord,\" he said,"},{"id":"s0-434","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"The stars are displaced"},{"id":"s0-435","sceneId":"s0","text":"\"By this towering wisdom.\""},{"id":"s1-0","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-1","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art the peace of sundown"},{"id":"s1-2","sceneId":"s1","text":"When the blue shadows soothe,"},{"id":"s1-3","sceneId":"s1","text":"And the grasses and the leaves sleep"},{"id":"s1-4","sceneId":"s1","text":"To the song of the little brooks,"},{"id":"s1-5","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-6","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-7","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a strorm"},{"id":"s1-8","sceneId":"s1","text":"That breaks black in the sky,"},{"id":"s1-9","sceneId":"s1","text":"And, sweeping headlong,"},{"id":"s1-10","sceneId":"s1","text":"Drenches and cowers each tree,"},{"id":"s1-11","sceneId":"s1","text":"And at the panting end"},{"id":"s1-12","sceneId":"s1","text":"There is no sound"},{"id":"s1-13","sceneId":"s1","text":"Save the melancholy cry of a single owl--"},{"id":"s1-14","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me!"},{"id":"s1-15","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou are my love,"},{"id":"s1-16","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a tinsel thing,"},{"id":"s1-17","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I in my play"},{"id":"s1-18","sceneId":"s1","text":"Broke thee easily,"},{"id":"s1-19","sceneId":"s1","text":"And from the little fragments"},{"id":"s1-20","sceneId":"s1","text":"Arose my long sorrow--"},{"id":"s1-21","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-22","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-23","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a wary violet,"},{"id":"s1-24","sceneId":"s1","text":"Drooping from sun-caresses,"},{"id":"s1-25","sceneId":"s1","text":"Answering mine carelessly--"},{"id":"s1-26","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-27","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-28","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art the ashes of other men's love,"},{"id":"s1-29","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I bury my face in these ashes,"},{"id":"s1-30","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I love them--"},{"id":"s1-31","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-32","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-33","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art the beard"},{"id":"s1-34","sceneId":"s1","text":"On another man's face--"},{"id":"s1-35","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-36","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-37","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a temple,"},{"id":"s1-38","sceneId":"s1","text":"And in this temple is an altar,"},{"id":"s1-39","sceneId":"s1","text":"And on this altar is my heart--"},{"id":"s1-40","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-41","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-42","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a wretch."},{"id":"s1-43","sceneId":"s1","text":"Let these sacred love-lies choke thee,"},{"id":"s1-44","sceneId":"s1","text":"From I am come to where I know your lies"},{"id":"s1-45","sceneId":"s1","text":"as truth"},{"id":"s1-46","sceneId":"s1","text":"And you truth as lies--"},{"id":"s1-47","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-48","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-49","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a priestess,"},{"id":"s1-50","sceneId":"s1","text":"And in they hand is a bloody dagger,"},{"id":"s1-51","sceneId":"s1","text":"And my doom comes to me surely--"},{"id":"s1-52","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-53","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-54","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art a skull with ruby eyes,"},{"id":"s1-55","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I love thee--"},{"id":"s1-56","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-57","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-58","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I doubt thee."},{"id":"s1-59","sceneId":"s1","text":"And if peace came with thy murder"},{"id":"s1-60","sceneId":"s1","text":"Then would I murder--"},{"id":"s1-61","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me."},{"id":"s1-62","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou art my love,"},{"id":"s1-63","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thou art death,"},{"id":"s1-64","sceneId":"s1","text":"Aye, thou art death"},{"id":"s1-65","sceneId":"s1","text":"Black and yet black,"},{"id":"s1-66","sceneId":"s1","text":"But I love thee,"},{"id":"s1-67","sceneId":"s1","text":"I love thee--"},{"id":"s1-68","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe, welcome woe, to me."},{"id":"s1-69","sceneId":"s1","text":"Love, forgive me if I wish you grief,"},{"id":"s1-70","sceneId":"s1","text":"For in your grief"},{"id":"s1-71","sceneId":"s1","text":"You huddle to my breast,"},{"id":"s1-72","sceneId":"s1","text":"And for it"},{"id":"s1-73","sceneId":"s1","text":"Would I pay the price of your grief."},{"id":"s1-74","sceneId":"s1","text":"You walk among men"},{"id":"s1-75","sceneId":"s1","text":"And all men do not surrender,"},{"id":"s1-76","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thus I understand"},{"id":"s1-77","sceneId":"s1","text":"That love reaches his hand"},{"id":"s1-78","sceneId":"s1","text":"In mercy to me."},{"id":"s1-79","sceneId":"s1","text":"He had your picture in his room,"},{"id":"s1-80","sceneId":"s1","text":"A scurvy traitor picture,"},{"id":"s1-81","sceneId":"s1","text":"And he smiled"},{"id":"s1-82","sceneId":"s1","text":"--Merely a fat complacence of men who"},{"id":"s1-83","sceneId":"s1","text":"know fine women--"},{"id":"s1-84","sceneId":"s1","text":"And thus I divided with him"},{"id":"s1-85","sceneId":"s1","text":"A part of my love."},{"id":"s1-86","sceneId":"s1","text":"Fool, not to know that thy little shoe"},{"id":"s1-87","sceneId":"s1","text":"Can make men weep!"},{"id":"s1-88","sceneId":"s1","text":"--Some men weep."},{"id":"s1-89","sceneId":"s1","text":"I weep and I gnash,"},{"id":"s1-90","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I love the little shoe,"},{"id":"s1-91","sceneId":"s1","text":"The little, little shoe."},{"id":"s1-92","sceneId":"s1","text":"God give me medals,"},{"id":"s1-93","sceneId":"s1","text":"God give me loud honors,"},{"id":"s1-94","sceneId":"s1","text":"That I may strut before you, sweetheart,"},{"id":"s1-95","sceneId":"s1","text":"And be worthy of--"},{"id":"s1-96","sceneId":"s1","text":"The love I bear you."},{"id":"s1-97","sceneId":"s1","text":"Now let me crunch you"},{"id":"s1-98","sceneId":"s1","text":"With full weight of affrighted love."},{"id":"s1-99","sceneId":"s1","text":"I doubted you"},{"id":"s1-100","sceneId":"s1","text":"--I doubted you--"},{"id":"s1-101","sceneId":"s1","text":"And in this short doubting"},{"id":"s1-102","sceneId":"s1","text":"My love grew like a genie"},{"id":"s1-103","sceneId":"s1","text":"For my further undoing."},{"id":"s1-104","sceneId":"s1","text":"Beware of my friends,"},{"id":"s1-105","sceneId":"s1","text":"Be not in speech too civil,"},{"id":"s1-106","sceneId":"s1","text":"For in all courtesy"},{"id":"s1-107","sceneId":"s1","text":"My weak heart sees spectres,"},{"id":"s1-108","sceneId":"s1","text":"Mists of desire"},{"id":"s1-109","sceneId":"s1","text":"Arising from the lips of my chosen;"},{"id":"s1-110","sceneId":"s1","text":"Be not civil."},{"id":"s1-111","sceneId":"s1","text":"The flower I gave thee once"},{"id":"s1-112","sceneId":"s1","text":"Was incident to a stride,"},{"id":"s1-113","sceneId":"s1","text":"A detail of a gesture,"},{"id":"s1-114","sceneId":"s1","text":"But search those pale petals"},{"id":"s1-115","sceneId":"s1","text":"And see engraven thereon"},{"id":"s1-116","sceneId":"s1","text":"A record of my intention."},{"id":"s1-117","sceneId":"s1","text":"Ah, God, the way your little finger moved,"},{"id":"s1-118","sceneId":"s1","text":"As you thrust a bare arm backward"},{"id":"s1-119","sceneId":"s1","text":"And made play with your hair"},{"id":"s1-120","sceneId":"s1","text":"And a comb, a silly gilt comb"},{"id":"s1-121","sceneId":"s1","text":"--Ah, God--that I should suffer"},{"id":"s1-122","sceneId":"s1","text":"Because of the way a little finger moved."},{"id":"s1-123","sceneId":"s1","text":"Once I saw thee idly rocking"},{"id":"s1-124","sceneId":"s1","text":"--Idly rocking--"},{"id":"s1-125","sceneId":"s1","text":"And chattering girlishly to other girls,"},{"id":"s1-126","sceneId":"s1","text":"Bell-voiced, happy,"},{"id":"s1-127","sceneId":"s1","text":"Careless with the stout heart of unscarred"},{"id":"s1-128","sceneId":"s1","text":"womanhood,"},{"id":"s1-129","sceneId":"s1","text":"And life to thee was all light melody."},{"id":"s1-130","sceneId":"s1","text":"I thought of the great storms of love as I"},{"id":"s1-131","sceneId":"s1","text":"knew it,"},{"id":"s1-132","sceneId":"s1","text":"Torn, miserable, and ashamed of my open"},{"id":"s1-133","sceneId":"s1","text":"sorrow,"},{"id":"s1-134","sceneId":"s1","text":"I thought of the thunders that lived in my"},{"id":"s1-135","sceneId":"s1","text":"head,"},{"id":"s1-136","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I wish to be an ogre,"},{"id":"s1-137","sceneId":"s1","text":"And hale and haul my beloved to a castle,"},{"id":"s1-138","sceneId":"s1","text":"And make her mourn with my mourning."},{"id":"s1-139","sceneId":"s1","text":"Tell me why, behind thee,"},{"id":"s1-140","sceneId":"s1","text":"I see always the shadow of another lover?"},{"id":"s1-141","sceneId":"s1","text":"Is it real,"},{"id":"s1-142","sceneId":"s1","text":"Or is this the thrice damned memory of a"},{"id":"s1-143","sceneId":"s1","text":"better happiness?"},{"id":"s1-144","sceneId":"s1","text":"Plague on him if he be dead,"},{"id":"s1-145","sceneId":"s1","text":"Plague on him if he be alive--"},{"id":"s1-146","sceneId":"s1","text":"A swinish numskull"},{"id":"s1-147","sceneId":"s1","text":"To intrude his shade"},{"id":"s1-148","sceneId":"s1","text":"Always between me and my peace!"},{"id":"s1-149","sceneId":"s1","text":"And yet I have seen thee happy with me."},{"id":"s1-150","sceneId":"s1","text":"I am no fool"},{"id":"s1-151","sceneId":"s1","text":"To poll stupidly into iron."},{"id":"s1-152","sceneId":"s1","text":"I have heard your quick breaths"},{"id":"s1-153","sceneId":"s1","text":"And seen your arms writhe toward me;"},{"id":"s1-154","sceneId":"s1","text":"At those times"},{"id":"s1-155","sceneId":"s1","text":"--God help us--"},{"id":"s1-156","sceneId":"s1","text":"I was impelled to be a grand knight,"},{"id":"s1-157","sceneId":"s1","text":"And swagger and snap my fingers,"},{"id":"s1-158","sceneId":"s1","text":"And explain my mind finely."},{"id":"s1-159","sceneId":"s1","text":"Oh, lost sweetheart,"},{"id":"s1-160","sceneId":"s1","text":"I would that I had not been a grand knight."},{"id":"s1-161","sceneId":"s1","text":"I said: \"Sweetheart.\""},{"id":"s1-162","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou said'st: \"Sweetheart.\""},{"id":"s1-163","sceneId":"s1","text":"And we preserved an admirable mimicry"},{"id":"s1-164","sceneId":"s1","text":"Without heeding the drip of the blood"},{"id":"s1-165","sceneId":"s1","text":"From my heart."},{"id":"s1-166","sceneId":"s1","text":"I heard thee laugh,"},{"id":"s1-167","sceneId":"s1","text":"And in this merriment"},{"id":"s1-168","sceneId":"s1","text":"I defined the measure of my pain;"},{"id":"s1-169","sceneId":"s1","text":"I knew that I was alone,"},{"id":"s1-170","sceneId":"s1","text":"Alone with love,"},{"id":"s1-171","sceneId":"s1","text":"Poor shivering love,"},{"id":"s1-172","sceneId":"s1","text":"And he, little sprite,"},{"id":"s1-173","sceneId":"s1","text":"Came to watch with me,"},{"id":"s1-174","sceneId":"s1","text":"And at midnight,"},{"id":"s1-175","sceneId":"s1","text":"We were like two creatures by a dead camp-fire."},{"id":"s1-176","sceneId":"s1","text":"I wonder if sometimes in the dusk,"},{"id":"s1-177","sceneId":"s1","text":"When the brave lights that gild thy"},{"id":"s1-178","sceneId":"s1","text":"evenings"},{"id":"s1-179","sceneId":"s1","text":"Have not yet been touched with flame,"},{"id":"s1-180","sceneId":"s1","text":"I wonder if sometimes in the dusk"},{"id":"s1-181","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thou rememberest a time,"},{"id":"s1-182","sceneId":"s1","text":"A time when thou loved me"},{"id":"s1-183","sceneId":"s1","text":"And our love was to thee thy all?"},{"id":"s1-184","sceneId":"s1","text":"Is the memory rubbish now?"},{"id":"s1-185","sceneId":"s1","text":"An old gown"},{"id":"s1-186","sceneId":"s1","text":"Worn in an age of other fashions?"},{"id":"s1-187","sceneId":"s1","text":"Woe is me, oh, lost one,"},{"id":"s1-188","sceneId":"s1","text":"For that love is now to me"},{"id":"s1-189","sceneId":"s1","text":"A supernal dream,"},{"id":"s1-190","sceneId":"s1","text":"White, white, white with many suns."},{"id":"s1-191","sceneId":"s1","text":"Love met me at noonday,"},{"id":"s1-192","sceneId":"s1","text":"--Reckless imp,"},{"id":"s1-193","sceneId":"s1","text":"To leave his shaded nights"},{"id":"s1-194","sceneId":"s1","text":"And brave the glare,--"},{"id":"s1-195","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I saw him then plainly"},{"id":"s1-196","sceneId":"s1","text":"For a bungler,"},{"id":"s1-197","sceneId":"s1","text":"A stupid, simpering, eyeless bungler,"},{"id":"s1-198","sceneId":"s1","text":"Breaking the hearts of brave people"},{"id":"s1-199","sceneId":"s1","text":"As the snivelling idiot-boy cracks his bowl,"},{"id":"s1-200","sceneId":"s1","text":"And I cursed him,"},{"id":"s1-201","sceneId":"s1","text":"Cursed him to and fro, back and forth,"},{"id":"s1-202","sceneId":"s1","text":"Into all the silly mazes of his mind,"},{"id":"s1-203","sceneId":"s1","text":"But in the end"},{"id":"s1-204","sceneId":"s1","text":"He laughed and pointed to my breast,"},{"id":"s1-205","sceneId":"s1","text":"Where a heart still beat for thee, beloved."},{"id":"s1-206","sceneId":"s1","text":"I have seen thy face aflame"},{"id":"s1-207","sceneId":"s1","text":"For love of me,"},{"id":"s1-208","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thy fair arms go mad,"},{"id":"s1-209","sceneId":"s1","text":"Thy lips tremble and mutter and rave."},{"id":"s2-0","sceneId":"s2","text":"This should leave a man content?"},{"id":"s2-1","sceneId":"s2","text":"Thou lovest not me now,"},{"id":"s2-2","sceneId":"s2","text":"But thou didst love me,"},{"id":"s2-3","sceneId":"s2","text":"And in loving me once"},{"id":"s2-4","sceneId":"s2","text":"Thou gavest me an eternal privilege,"},{"id":"s2-5","sceneId":"s2","text":"For I can think of thee."}]}
